}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If set to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":", a currently running request will be cancelled before a new request is made If set to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":", no refetch will be made if there is already a request running."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"<a id=\"property-throwonerror\">"},{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"</a>"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"throwOnError?"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If set to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":", the method throws if any of the underlying query refetch tasks fail. If set to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":", failed refetches are swallowed and not surfaced to the caller."}]}]]}],"headings":[{"id":"extends","text":"Extends","level":2},{"id":"extended-by","text":"Extended by","level":2},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:875](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L875)\n\nOptions of the methods that refetch queries, like `refetch` and `queryClient.refetchQueries`.\n\n## Extends\n\n- [`ResultOptions`](ResultOptions.md)\n\n## Extended by\n\n- [`InvalidateOptions`](InvalidateOptions.md)\n- [`ResetOptions`](ResetOptions.md)\n\n## Properties\n\n| Property | Type | Default value | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"property-cancelrefetch\"></a> `cancelRefetch?` | `boolean` | `true` | If set to `true`, a currently running request will be cancelled before a new request is made If set to `false`, no refetch will be made if there is already a request running. |\n| <a id=\"property-throwonerror\"></a> `throwOnError?` | `boolean` | `false` | If set to `true`, the method throws if any of the underlying query refetch tasks fail. If set to `false`, failed refetches are swallowed and not surfaced to the caller. |\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: RefetchOptions\ntitle: RefetchOptions\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:875](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L875)\n\nOptions of the methods that refetch queries, like `refetch` and `queryClient.refetchQueries`.\n\n## Extends\n\n- [`ResultOptions`](ResultOptions.md)\n\n## Extended by\n\n- [`InvalidateOptions`](InvalidateOptions.md)\n- [`ResetOptions`](ResetOptions.md)\n\n## Properties\n\n| Property | Type | Default value | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"property-cancelrefetch\"></a> `cancelRefetch?` | `boolean` | `true` | If set to `true`, a currently running request will be cancelled before a new request is made If set to `false`, no refetch will be made if there is already a request running. |\n| <a id=\"property-throwonerror\"></a> `throwOnError?` | `boolean` | `false` | If set to `true`, the method throws if any of the underlying query refetch tasks fail. If set to `false`, failed refetches are swallowed and not surfaced to the caller. |\n"}
